# The loop returns only after `q.toLowerCase()`, so every loop that begins an iteration makes the call. It is hoisted into the preheader of the specialized version: the call, and the jump to the loop header.
# RUN: walk f1:Body mechanisms=all
# CHECK: ) isInLoop=true isLoopHead=true:
# CHECK: inlineBuiltin=StringToLowerCase
# CHECK-NEXT: Jump -> next
# CHECK-NOT: inlineBuiltin=StringToLowerCase
